1
00:00:36,800 --> 00:00:42,350
[She's Wild Fire]

2
00:00:43,550 --> 00:00:47,620
[Episode 19: Every Crisis is an Opportunity]

3
00:01:03,800 --> 00:01:05,330
You're really ignoring me?

4
00:01:10,960 --> 00:01:12,400
I know I was wrong.

5
00:01:13,280 --> 00:01:14,539
I'll never do it again.

6
00:01:19,440 --> 00:01:20,520
How about...

7
00:01:23,000 --> 00:01:24,400
you yell at me?

8
00:01:33,440 --> 00:01:34,320
Or...

9
00:01:38,400 --> 00:01:39,000
like this?

10
00:01:39,259 --> 00:01:40,380
Are you still mad?

11
00:01:41,960 --> 00:01:42,800
Xie Nanfeng,

12
00:01:43,640 --> 00:01:45,039
can you be a bit more serious?

13
00:01:45,039 --> 00:01:45,600
Okay.

14
00:01:46,160 --> 00:01:46,720
Serious.

15
00:01:46,759 --> 00:01:47,920
I deeply realize that

16
00:01:47,920 --> 00:01:49,400
disregarding my own safety

17
00:01:49,400 --> 00:01:51,400
is extremely wrong and dangerous.

18
00:01:51,479 --> 00:01:53,920
And making my family and loved ones worry

19
00:01:53,920 --> 00:01:55,400
is highly irresponsible.

20
00:01:56,280 --> 00:01:57,000
I promise

21
00:01:57,520 --> 00:01:58,479
to correct it immediately.

22
00:01:58,479 --> 00:02:00,410
I request immediate supervision!

23
00:02:04,200 --> 00:02:05,600
I'm not falling for that.

24
00:02:07,640 --> 00:02:08,970
You're not mad anymore?

25
00:02:12,120 --> 00:02:13,720
I'm not that easy to appease.

26
00:02:16,720 --> 00:02:19,800
Then what would make it easier?

27
00:02:19,960 --> 00:02:21,600
Give me a hint, Mr. Chu.

28
00:02:30,240 --> 00:02:31,840
You really know my weak spot.

29
00:02:33,320 --> 00:02:35,200
So you forgive me?

30
00:02:36,320 --> 00:02:37,960
Just this once.

31
00:02:38,200 --> 00:02:38,800
Okay.

32
00:02:39,040 --> 00:02:39,770
Understood.

33
00:02:46,200 --> 00:02:47,600
You're the best, Mr. Chu.

34
00:02:48,800 --> 00:02:50,130
Alright, let's go home.

35
00:02:50,520 --> 00:02:51,780
What do you want to eat?

36
00:02:53,079 --> 00:02:54,200
No rush.

37
00:02:54,920 --> 00:02:56,720
There's still a score to settle.

38
00:03:04,160 --> 00:03:05,200
Ms. Xie,

39
00:03:05,440 --> 00:03:07,160
this dog of mine

40
00:03:07,160 --> 00:03:08,400
isn't very obedient.

41
00:03:08,520 --> 00:03:09,360
He follows a scent

42
00:03:09,360 --> 00:03:10,520
and runs around wildly.

43
00:03:10,520 --> 00:03:13,200
He almost hurt an important guest
by accident.

44
00:03:13,560 --> 00:03:16,020
It's my fault
for not disciplining him well.

45
00:03:19,400 --> 00:03:20,840
You're too kind, Ms. Wan.

46
00:03:21,160 --> 00:03:22,360
If a dog bites,

47
00:03:22,360 --> 00:03:24,220
it certainly deserves a beating.

48
00:03:24,440 --> 00:03:26,600
But before letting a dog out to bite,

49
00:03:26,840 --> 00:03:28,079
shouldn't the owner

50
00:03:28,960 --> 00:03:30,800
hold the leash tighter?

51
00:03:36,560 --> 00:03:37,520
Ms. Xie,

52
00:03:38,260 --> 00:03:40,520
are you trying to tell me
how to do things?

53
00:03:42,240 --> 00:03:44,760
I have been in Shencheng for years.

54
00:03:45,130 --> 00:03:46,480
No one has the right to teach me

55
00:03:46,480 --> 00:03:48,280
how to manage my people.

56
00:03:49,480 --> 00:03:50,880
As for our score,

57
00:03:51,620 --> 00:03:53,820
we'll settle it properly in six months.

58
00:04:02,000 --> 00:04:02,800
Fine.

59
00:04:03,720 --> 00:04:04,800
In six months,

60
00:04:06,410 --> 00:04:07,930
we'll settle it.

61
00:04:27,160 --> 00:04:28,400
In six months,

62
00:04:28,680 --> 00:04:29,800
you will see with your own eyes

63
00:04:29,800 --> 00:04:32,600
the Dongmen Trade Center
built up from the ground.

64
00:04:32,640 --> 00:04:33,770
It's just a pity that

65
00:04:33,840 --> 00:04:35,000
the tide of history

66
00:04:35,280 --> 00:04:37,400
always washes away the scum.

67
00:04:38,440 --> 00:04:39,600
By then,

68
00:04:41,670 --> 00:04:43,510
you won't even be a match for me.

69
00:04:55,760 --> 00:04:56,320
Ms. Xie,

70
00:04:56,230 --> 00:04:59,590
[Six Months Later,
Dongmen Trade Market, Dongmen Building]

71
00:04:57,120 --> 00:04:58,720
some merchants have come,

72
00:04:58,720 --> 00:04:59,640
but those big factories

73
00:04:59,640 --> 00:05:01,970
and clothing companies refuse to move in.

74
00:05:02,040 --> 00:05:04,170
Everyone wants to monopolize the market.

75
00:05:04,170 --> 00:05:05,880
They're afraid that packing together

76
00:05:05,880 --> 00:05:08,680
will lead to undercutting
and stealing business.

77
00:05:10,040 --> 00:05:10,680
No rush.

78
00:05:11,070 --> 00:05:12,330
When the tide goes out,

79
00:05:12,920 --> 00:05:14,520
everyone thinks they can swim.

80
00:05:14,520 --> 00:05:15,960
When the time comes,

81
00:05:17,160 --> 00:05:19,020
they'll come ashore on their own.

82
00:05:22,040 --> 00:05:24,000
Dongmen is a true goldmine!

83
00:05:24,000 --> 00:05:26,320
Nanfeng Garments is destined for wealth!

84
00:05:26,320 --> 00:05:29,640
Wishing Ms. Xie booming business
across the globe!

85
00:05:29,720 --> 00:05:32,200
May wealth pour in from all directions!

86
00:05:32,360 --> 00:05:34,720
May customers flock in
and bring endless fortune!

87
00:05:34,720 --> 00:05:35,920
Congratulations, Ms. Xie!

88
00:05:35,920 --> 00:05:37,400
Happy grand opening!

89
00:05:37,400 --> 00:05:40,600
Congratulations!

90
00:05:44,880 --> 00:05:46,159
All for show.

91
00:05:46,159 --> 00:05:48,800
It's actually dead quiet in there.

92
00:05:48,800 --> 00:05:50,520
Thank you, everyone!

93
00:05:51,640 --> 00:05:52,520
How is it?

94
00:05:53,280 --> 00:05:54,360
Grand enough?

95
00:05:55,120 --> 00:05:57,920
You really know
how to pull off these tricks.

96
00:05:58,680 --> 00:06:00,120
Of course.

97
00:06:00,880 --> 00:06:02,560
We have to set the vibe.

98
00:06:05,200 --> 00:06:07,200
Booming business!

99
00:06:07,960 --> 00:06:10,000
Thanks, Chunsheng.

100
00:06:11,680 --> 00:06:13,080
It won't be long

101
00:06:13,110 --> 00:06:15,210
before you have to shut down for good.

102
00:06:22,880 --> 00:06:25,160
The international financial market
continues to fluctuate.

103
00:06:25,160 --> 00:06:27,720
It has affected Southeast Asia
and South China.

104
00:06:27,720 --> 00:06:30,280
Garment export enterprises in many regions
face sharp order drops.

105
00:06:30,280 --> 00:06:34,140
A wave of bankruptcies among small
and medium factories is emerging.

106
00:06:34,630 --> 00:06:36,030
The final piece of my plan

107
00:06:36,040 --> 00:06:39,080
is this financial crisis.

108
00:06:40,240 --> 00:06:42,920
The garment industry
is highly competitive.

109
00:06:43,360 --> 00:06:44,400
Many enterprises

110
00:06:44,400 --> 00:06:46,800
were struggling on the edge of survival.

111
00:06:47,600 --> 00:06:48,730
Once the storm hits,

112
00:06:48,960 --> 00:06:50,400
it's a fatal blow.

113
00:06:51,210 --> 00:06:52,450
But a crisis

114
00:06:52,470 --> 00:06:54,510
always comes with an opportunity.

115
00:06:55,200 --> 00:06:57,980
When individuals
can't withstand the risk alone,

116
00:06:57,980 --> 00:07:01,100
huddling together
becomes their only way out.

117
00:07:01,440 --> 00:07:02,480
And Dongmen

118
00:07:02,630 --> 00:07:04,990
is the sanctuary I've prepared for them.

119
00:07:06,160 --> 00:07:09,680
[Dongmen Garment Distribution Center]

120
00:07:06,640 --> 00:07:07,400
Ms. Xie,

121
00:07:07,400 --> 00:07:09,760
with the whole industry
taking a massive hit,

122
00:07:09,760 --> 00:07:11,480
Dongmen managed to break through
against the trend,

123
00:07:11,480 --> 00:07:13,080
becoming a safe haven
for many enterprises.

124
00:07:13,080 --> 00:07:15,320
How did you come up with this layout?

125
00:07:16,640 --> 00:07:19,280
I just dropped the anchor
before the storm hit.

126
00:07:19,800 --> 00:07:22,480
Doing business requires
daring to push forward,

127
00:07:22,480 --> 00:07:24,120
but more importantly, it requires knowing

128
00:07:24,120 --> 00:07:27,080
how to leave a way out
for your peers and yourself.

129
00:07:39,760 --> 00:07:40,420
Madam Hong,

130
00:07:40,560 --> 00:07:42,240
do you still remember Xie Nanfeng?

131
00:07:42,240 --> 00:07:45,040
She made the cover
of the latest Financial Weekly.

132
00:07:45,060 --> 00:07:47,409
[Xie Nanfeng: Shencheng's Queen of the Storm, Building a Business Legend]

133
00:07:45,320 --> 00:07:47,680
She promised me to leave Chunsheng,

134
00:07:47,680 --> 00:07:48,880
and leave Shencheng.

135
00:07:49,320 --> 00:07:51,560
Yet now she returns with such fanfare,

136
00:07:51,960 --> 00:07:54,360
and makes her business
such a huge success.

137
00:07:54,920 --> 00:07:56,480
She's really fearless now.

138
00:07:56,480 --> 00:07:58,240
Not long after she
went over there,

139
00:07:58,240 --> 00:07:59,760
she gave birth to a child.

140
00:07:59,760 --> 00:08:00,440
What?

141
00:08:02,360 --> 00:08:03,440
Are you saying...

142
00:08:04,200 --> 00:08:05,920
she had a baby in America?

143
00:08:12,480 --> 00:08:14,040
So I'm a grandmother now?

144
00:08:15,080 --> 00:08:16,280
Looks like the family

145
00:08:16,360 --> 00:08:17,560
finally has an heir.

146
00:08:18,910 --> 00:08:19,760
[Dongmen Trade Center Owners' Committee]

147
00:08:24,000 --> 00:08:24,760
Everyone,

148
00:08:25,310 --> 00:08:26,700
our Dongmen Trade Center's

149
00:08:26,700 --> 00:08:28,560
first-quarter results are here.

150
00:08:28,840 --> 00:08:29,770
The sales volume

151
00:08:33,000 --> 00:08:34,840
has far exceeded expectations!

152
00:08:35,230 --> 00:08:35,990
Awesome!

153
00:08:40,120 --> 00:08:40,799
And

154
00:08:41,320 --> 00:08:44,440
even orders from Southeast Asia
are pouring in!

155
00:08:44,520 --> 00:08:48,320
Our Fashion Flower has gone global!

156
00:08:52,240 --> 00:08:53,160
Thanks to Ms. Xie,

157
00:08:53,160 --> 00:08:54,800
we were able to survive this crisis.

158
00:08:54,800 --> 00:08:55,560
Following Ms. Xie

159
00:08:55,560 --> 00:08:56,920
is definitely the right choice!

160
00:08:56,920 --> 00:08:58,440
Thank you all for your hard work too.

161
00:08:58,440 --> 00:08:59,700
Great work, everyone.

162
00:08:59,790 --> 00:09:00,250
I

163
00:09:00,270 --> 00:09:01,080
ordered a cake.

164
00:09:01,080 --> 00:09:03,010
We are not talking business today.

165
00:09:03,040 --> 00:09:04,500
Let's have a celebration!

166
00:09:04,600 --> 00:09:05,640
Okay.

167
00:09:15,000 --> 00:09:16,600
This isn't the one I ordered.

168
00:09:16,600 --> 00:09:17,760
You delivered the wrong one, right?

169
00:09:17,760 --> 00:09:20,080
This was sent by Ms. Wan.

170
00:09:20,200 --> 00:09:21,960
As special congratulations

171
00:09:21,960 --> 00:09:25,440
on Dongmen Trade Center's solid start.

172
00:09:36,280 --> 00:09:37,680
Ms. Wan said,

173
00:09:37,680 --> 00:09:39,920
give this piece to Miss Xie first.

174
00:09:40,200 --> 00:09:44,920
A cake this big
is too much for one person.
